      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In this report is introduced a method of 3 D reconstruction of the LV by echocardiography. It was verified that 3 D image reconstruction could evaluate the function of the LV quantitatively in various cardiac disorders. And according to the specific display features of colored 3 D segmental shortening, it could also make diagnosis for certain heart diseases such as ischemic heart disease; hypertrophic or congestive cardiomyopathy, myocarditis, rheumatic heart disease; etc."},
